  <item>
    <title>让Agent从Chat走向Act -- 我在亚马逊云AI初创活动上的分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b8643833591c27be39e2e5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b8643833591c27be39e2e5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Aug 2024 07:11:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上周受亚马逊云的邀请，在一个线下五六十人的会场讨论了Agent的话题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>活动内容非常精彩，嘉宾和听众的提问都很有质量。场地和一个中学教室差不多，观众和讲台的距离不足半米，没有麦克风，观众和嘉宾更像是探讨而不是单向分享。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次的会议的主题是Agent, 我分享的题目《从chat到act, 让你的agent从好玩走向实用》。今天跟大家同步分享在我的小宇宙，PPT在</span><a href="https://a8o6k6y8gp.feishu.cn/slides/BSm0sOtgdliYkZdxfM7cDJLTnMe?from=from_copylink" data-url="https://a8o6k6y8gp.feishu.cn/slides/BSm0sOtgdliYkZdxfM7cDJLTnMe?from=from_copylink"><span>飞书</span></a><span>上可以阅读。</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. mind2Web: <a data-url="https://osu-nlp-group.github.io/Mind2Web/" href="https://osu-nlp-group.github.io/Mind2Web/">osu-nlp-group.github.io</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>2. OpenAI cookbook: <a data-url="https://cookbook.openai.com/examples/fine_tuning_for_function_calling" href="https://cookbook.openai.com/examples/fine_tuning_for_function_calling">cookbook.openai.com</a></span></p><span></span><h2><span>时间线</span></h2><span></span><h2><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 引言。</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 什么是从Chat走向Act。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> Act Agent 和RPA, Dify, Coze的区别。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">08:53</a> 实现从Chat 走向 Act： 通过Agent tuning， 设计模式提高Agent 规划思考能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 通过function calling tuning &nbsp;让Agent执行精准力提高。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fihu7qzA_8RpEASTdop2H_tfk_de.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a> 展望软件2.0。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltQamTv2Y64vYGIxli8w5oBX9H-z.m4a" length="22356881" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:23:02</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh-w5e8v62a7ufUon5286G_IVQHi.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>All In AI后的一年，我对生活和AI的全新认知</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/669d319737236c546eb80c19</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">669d319737236c546eb80c19</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Jul 2024 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello 大家好，一年不见，二姐终于更新了</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一档和 </span><strong><span>伏脉千里 </span></strong><span>的串台节目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我和老朋友奈飞 &nbsp;回顾了过去一年我的自由职业生涯，以及对AI的全新认知，相信会对你有些启发，话不多说，enjoy。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">02:01</a> 辞职后的几个爽点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 我的自媒体:从费曼到纳瓦尔宝典</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 过去一年AI的变化： 产品多样化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">31:35</a> 国内的AI现在还在抄吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> Software 2.0的探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2722">45:22</a> 关于GPU 的探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> AI 搜索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a> 企业里的AI应用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 大模型能力数据挑战:中文与英文的差异探究</span></p><span></span><h2><span>推荐精品个人博客：</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>OpenAI 创始人Kaparthy</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>karpathy medium(类似国际版公众号): <a data-url="https://karpathy.medium.com/" href="https://karpathy.medium.com/">karpathy.medium.com</a> 最新到2017年，可以看看openAI六年前的先知理念。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>youtube: <a data-url="https://www.youtube.com/@AndrejKarpathy/videos" href="https://www.youtube.com/@AndrejKarpathy/videos">www.youtube.com</a>, 各种神经网络原理，讲解。最新更新在9天前，以2-3个月一次的频率在更新</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>twitter(X): <a data-url="https://x.com/karpathy" href="https://x.com/karpathy">x.com</a> 最新观点</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>github 博客： <a data-url="https://karpathy.github.io/" href="https://karpathy.github.io/">karpathy.github.io</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>个人博客：<a data-url="https://karpathy.ai/" href="https://karpathy.ai/">karpathy.ai</a></span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Karpathy的开源大模型培训课， 现在只有大纲，就攒了13K star，GitHub - karpathy/LLM101n: LLM101n: Let's build a Storyteller</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>Anthropic 联合创始人Christopher Olah 的博客：<a data-url="https://colah.github.io/" href="https://colah.github.io/">colah.github.io</a></span></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2>]]></description>
