    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这里是产品二姐，产品二姐很二，有两个频道：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>一个分享产品经理工作，就叫产品二姐，最近在学习、讨论人工智能。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>另一个记录日常生活，叫产品二姐番外篇。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>文字内容在微信公众号/知乎： 产品二姐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>---------</span></p><span></span><p><span>前两期和大家整体聊一下AI的进化史，随后会有几个系列，大家持续关注哦！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>跟着图灵奖大神学习人工智能系列</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>AI各个垂直领域的进化史</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>如何和孩子聊人工智能</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>产品背后的算法</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>各种AI 产品分析</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内容：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期邀请一位程序员朋友（</span><strong><span>小宇宙搜：中年会客厅</span></strong><span>）一起聊聊AI进化史上半阶段。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="163">2:43</a>'' 为什么要从历史角度研究AI</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">7:19</a>'' AI 缘起及诞生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="734">12:14</a>’‘ AI 第一次爆发期（1956-1974）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1807">30:07</a>‘’ AI第一次寒冬（1974-1980）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1982">33:02</a>’‘ AI 第二次爆发（1980-1987）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2354">39:14</a>‘’ AI第二次寒冬（1987-1994）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2841">47:21</a>’‘ 人工神经网络复苏（1980s）</span></p><span></span><p><span>文字内容整理在</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>知乎: </span><a href="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/645402858" data-url="https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/645402858"><span>三张图讲述一部AI 进化史</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>微信公众号: </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyODY0MTQ4OA==&amp;mid=2247483788&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5444bad0f8b40cd780944d02e5bcbb0d&amp;chksm=fa6c7d33cd1bf4251509ba596e1e4c3e12f43ef7d507c0609a097e249ec5d0f9ff8a5834b47f&amp;token=137459713&amp;lang=zh_CN#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzUyODY0MTQ4OA==&amp;mid=2247483788&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=5444bad0f8b40cd780944d02e5bcbb0d&amp;chksm=fa6c7d33cd1bf4251509ba596e1e4c3e12f43ef7d507c0609a097e249ec5d0f9ff8a5834b47f&amp;token=137459713&amp;lang=zh_CN#rd"><span>三张图讲述一部AI 进化史</span></a></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjm4i_Gk8zfuZvoqAKuFCr_vmT2j.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>大家enjoy！</span></p>]]></description>
